    {
      "id": "98c5f3f9-19e9-413d-976c-568f74bf6e42",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -256,
        -1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1300,
        "height": 1180,
        "content": "# Automate LinkedIn, RemoteOK and We Work Remotely job search and outreach with Periodix Actions and AI\n\nThis is the only job search template that closes the loop: it does not just find and score openings, it applies and reaches out. A daily agent searches LinkedIn, RemoteOK, and We Work Remotely in one run, scores every job against your profile with AI, drafts a tailored application note for the strong fits, then resolves the hiring company's LinkedIn page (even for non-LinkedIn boards), finds the exact person you want to reach — recruiter, hiring manager, CEO, CTO, whoever you choose — and sends them a personalized connection request under your own name. Every match is verified, not guessed, and every row in your Sheet shows whether it was confirmed or a fallback.\n\n### How it works\n1. Periodix Actions runs your LinkedIn Jobs search daily; RemoteOK and We Work Remotely add remote roles.\n2. All three sources are normalized, merged, and deduplicated.\n3. For jobs without a known LinkedIn company (mainly RemoteOK and We Work Remotely), Periodix Actions searches LinkedIn company pages by name, matching on normalized name similarity.\n4. AI scores each job 1 to 10 for fit and classifies work mode.\n5. Strong fits get a personalized application note.\n6. For any job with a resolved company, Periodix Actions searches for people matching your chosen recipient titles and picks the one whose headline actually matches.\n7. AI drafts a connection request note referencing the specific role, and Periodix Actions sends it under your profile.\n8. Every job, sent or not, lands in Google Sheets with its score, note, outreach status, and company_match/recipient_match columns showing verified, unverified_fallback, not_found, or skipped.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the Periodix Actions node: a verified n8n community node for LinkedIn and Sales Navigator that works on both n8n Cloud and self-hosted. \n    Sign up at actions.periodix.net and connect a LinkedIn profile.\n2. Fill Search Config: keywords, geo, freshness, your candidate profile, and recipient_titles — who you want to reach at each company (default Recruiter, Talent Acquisition, Technical Recruiter, Hiring Manager; set to CEO, CTO, or anything you prefer).\n3. Add your AI provider key to the AI nodes (Claude, OpenAI, or Gemini all work).\n4. Connect your Google Sheet with a Leads tab.\n\nBuilt with: Periodix Actions. Free trial available. Search results start at $10/1,000, unlimited from $49/month.\n\n### Customization\nCompany and recipient matching are never silently guessed: unverified_fallback means it took the top search result without a confirmed match, so you can filter those out in Sheets if you only want confirmed outreach. Periodix Actions connects through LinkedIn's own infrustructure, not a browser scraper: no cookies, no CAPTCHA, no scraper fingerprint. Built entirely on Periodix's infrastructure (rated 4.9/5 on G2), at 5 to 18 times lower cost than a comparable Clay or Apollo setup."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
